  "The SR-71 starts at (2, 4). After moving it 4 steps right and 1 step up, it will be at (6, 5).\n\nDoes that make sense?": "64bddc63319b0325.mp3",
  "The SR-71 starts at (2, 4). Move it 4 steps right: x goes from 2 to 6. Move it 1 step up: y goes from 4 to 5. It lands on (6, 5).": "82d17c49c2f591fe.mp3",
  "Watch one SR-71 move. The others move the same.": "a870936b791e6d36.mp3",
