  "Each SR-71 moves 1 step right and 3 steps up, so the translation is (1, 3). For example, (4, 1) moves to (5, 4).": "61489c0c42d6d562.mp3",
  "A translation by (2, 1) will move the SR-71s 2 steps right and 1 step up, landing on the targets.\n\nDoes that make sense?": "8e5a26bd34006d54.mp3",
